  "brief_en": "Create a 20-second travel-brand montage using music.wav, the supplied vector postcards, and the three MP4 clips. The assets are original stylized illustrations, not photographic footage. Let the music dictate major cuts and the build toward the final brand card. Use at least four postcards and two clips. Keep on-screen copy short and end on the provided brand line.",
  "brief_zh": "使用 music.wav、矢量旅行明信片和三段 MP4 制作 20 秒旅行品牌蒙太奇。素材是原创风格化插画，不是实拍。让音乐决定主要切镜和高潮，至少使用四张明信片与两段视频。画面文案简短，最后停留在给定品牌句上。",
